        "original_id": "e1e14da8-63dd-5431-abb1-36dfbadbd1e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Liaoyang, Changchun, Liaoning province, T'ai-tzu River\n- People: Yuan Baojing\n- Topics: Population, metropolitan areas\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Liaoyang and Anshan together formed a metropolitan area with 2,057,200 inhabitants.\n- In 2010, Changchun had a total population of 7,674,439 under its jurisdiction, according to the China census.\n- Liaoyang is a prefecture-level city in east-central Liaoning province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Liaoyang is situated on the T'ai-tzu River.\n- Yuan Baojing was born on 16 February 1966.\n- Yuan Baojing was a Chinese billionaire from Liaoyang, Liaoning province.\n- Yuan Baojing died on 17 March 2006.",
